  "display_title": "My Crush Got Possessed by the Duke",
  "description": "So-A knows that having a crush on a childhood friend can be complicated, but it’s even harder when he gets possessed by… the duke?! When So-A’s friend Yu-Seong is suddenly possessed by Duke Hereis De Licariel, they must figure out a way to get Hereis back home -- which is easier said than done when Hereis sounds like he came straight out of a fantasy novel! Can So-A get her childhood friend back while having to juggle academics, sports, and a duke who also happens to be a swordmaster? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
